From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: computerguy526 <355510486+computerguy526@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 21:19:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 21/22] kosmickrisp: nps5_kk_cmd_metalfx, MetalFX
 temporal/spatial upscale of application images inside a command buffer

Exported driver symbol (not a Vulkan entry point) for one-time-submit command buffers:
MTL4FXTemporalScaler (colour, depth, motion, jitter; optional compute pass removing the
projection jitter from the motion vectors) or MTL4FXSpatialScaler, ordered with explicit
barrier encoders. Evaluation and ordering after NXNative (github.com/seedds/nxnative, MIT).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
